# PRIVATIZED 2026-08-19. The queue files were tracked because git was their only
# backup, which made the complete internal findings register (security detail
# included) publicly fetchable on this Pages-served repo for weeks. Backup duty
# moved to the daily snapshot at C:\Users\Kane\Backups\YaE-queue-snapshots (written
# by the temp-cleanup task); the derived dashboard/data/queue.json is generated
# locally for the locally-served dashboard and never published. Do not re-track any
# of the three without superseding this decision in X:\DECISIONS.md.
.work-queue.json
.work-queue-archive.json
dashboard/data/queue.json
.work-queue.json.lock
.work-queue.json.corrupt-*
# Timestamped queue backups. `*.bak` above does not catch these - the suffix
# lands AFTER .bak (.bak-1781024899, .bak.1778937105), so four of them sat
# tracked in this public repo until 2026-07-30. Backups live in
# C:\Users\Kane\Backups\YaE-queue-snapshots, not here.
.work-queue.json.bak*
.work-queue.json.recon
.work-queue-results/
.work-queue-drain-log.json
.work-queue.lock
.work-queue.json.tmp
.work-queue.json.ser-in.tmp
.work-queue.json.ser-out.tmp

